  ]
 
 MonitorKeypadTable      ; internal key number, CMOS bits
@@ -2175,7 +2177,9 @@ RealIRQHandler
  [ ProcessorVectors
         LDR     PC, .-&18+ProcVec_IRQ
  |
-        B     Initial_IRQ_Code+.-&18
